      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Chef Barinov is away, guest chef Elena Sokolova introduces a remarkably calm and respectful atmosphere to Claude Monet's kitchen. Praising the cooks and gently managing an urgent food ticket for waitress Sasha, Elena demonstrates an entirely different leadership style. Let's listen to their polite kitchen dialogue in Russian.",
